"author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"世事浑无定。","body":25},{"id":"song:17109","title":"贺新郎","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"花落风初定。","body":25},{"id":"song:17110","title":"贺新郎","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"更静钟初定。","body":25},{"id":"song:17111","title":"八声甘州","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"叹人生聊尔，便晨风、翼倦也回飞。","body":25},{"id":"song:17112","title":"洞仙歌","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"青衫白发，独倚江楼小。","body":25},{"id":"song:17113","title":"玉漏迟","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"问春先开未，江南野水，得春初小。","body":25},{"id":"song:17114","title":"蓦山溪","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"飞仙欲下，水殿严妆早。","body":25},{"id":"song:17115","title":"蓦山溪","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"春工未觉，何处琼英早。","body":25},{"id":"song:17116","title":"蓦山溪","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"蓬蓬窣窣，睡梦惊回早。","body":25},{"id":"song:17117","title":"沁园春","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"孔盖霓旌，月佩云裳，人间女仙。","body":25},{"id":"song:17118","title":"浣溪沙","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"细柳连营绿荫重。","body":25},{"id":"song:17119","title":"浣溪沙","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"金紫山前山万重。","body":25},{"id":"song:17120","title":"蝶恋花","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"风信花残吹柳絮。","body":25},{"id":"song:17121","title":"大江东去・念奴娇","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"半生习气，被风霜、销尽头颅如许。","body":25},{"id":"song:17122","title":"玉漏迟","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"青衫华发，对风霜、倚遍危楼孤啸。","body":25},{"id":"song:17123","title":"玉漏迟","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"自怜翠袖，向天寒、独倚孤篁吟啸。","body":25},{"id":"song:17124","title":"水龙吟","author":"宋 · 何梦桂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"分知白首天寒，千林摇落寻真隐。","body":25},{"id":"song:17125","title":"八