g:17141","title":"玉漏迟","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"絮花寒食路。","body":104},{"id":"song:17142","title":"法曲献仙音","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"花匣么弦，象奁双陆，旧日留欢情意。","body":104},{"id":"song:17143","title":"瑞鹤仙","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"客边情味恶。","body":104},{"id":"song:17144","title":"瑞鹤仙","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"冻痕消梦草。","body":104},{"id":"song:17145","title":"好事近","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"人去绿屏闲，逗晓柳丝风急。","body":104},{"id":"song:17146","title":"好事近","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"小枕梦催闲，飞雨时鸣高屋。","body":104},{"id":"song:17147","title":"鱼游春水","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"青楼临远水。","body":104},{"id":"song:17148","title":"千秋岁","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"莺啼晴昼，南国春如绣。","body":104},{"id":"song:17149","title":"风入松","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"曲尘风雨乱春晴。","body":104},{"id":"song:17150","title":"水龙吟","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"几年埋玉蓝田，绿云翠水烘春暖。","body":104},{"id":"song:17151","title":"隔浦莲近・隔浦莲近拍","author":"宋 · 赵闻礼","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"愁红飞眩醉眼。","body":104}]